":"Odprava ({undo}) in namigi ({hint}) so na voljo v praksi. Pauza z {pause}.","Scoring":"Točkovanje","Score = food + growth + rival defeats + survival + objectives. Ties break on completion, then fewer invalid moves, then faster time.":"Ocena = hrana + rast + porazi tekmecev + preživetje + cilji. Po zaključku se razpade, potem manj nepravilnih potez, potem hitrejši čas.","Replay tutorials":"Ponovno predvajanje vadnic","← Back":"← Nazaj","Achievements":"Dosežki","Cosmetics":"Kosmetični izdelki","Cosmetics change looks only — never hitboxes, timing, or power.":"Kozmetika se spreminja samo na — nikoli hitbox, čas ali moč.","{name} ({cost} mastery)":"{name} ({cost} obvladovanje)","Open journey map":"Odprti zemljevid potovanja","Display name":"Prikazno ime","Save":"Shrani","Casual board — offline scores are not server-validated.":"Očitne ocene plošče — brez povezave niso potrjene s strežnikom.","No scores yet. Be the first!":"Še ni rezultatov. Bodi prvi!","seed {seed}":"seme {seed}","golden berry at column {x}, row {y}":"zlata jagodica v stolpcu {x}, vrstica {y}","berry at column {x}, row {y}":"jagode v stolpcu {x}, vrstica {y}","hunter at column {x}, row {y}":"Lovci v stolpcu {x}, vrstica {y}","Arena {w} by {h}. Serpent length {len}, heading {dir}, head at column {x}, row {y}.":"Arena {w} z {h}. Dolžina kače {len}, smer {dir}, glava na stolpcu {x}, vrstica {y}.","Food: {list}.":"Hrana: {list}.","none":"nič","Threats: {list}":"Grožnje: {list}","No hunters.":"Brez lovcev.","Ranked":"Uvrščen","Unranked":"Brez uvrstitve","Morning Meadow":"Jutranji travnik.","Sunset Orchard":"Sadovnik za sončni zahod","Moonlit Pond":"Mesečevi ribnik","Autumn Hollow":"Jesenska votlina","Coral Dunes":"Koralne peščene pečine","First Slither":"Prvi Slither","Berry Trail":"Jagodna steza","Long Way Round":"Dolga pot okrog","Mastery: The Open Field":"Vodenje: odprto polje","Growing Pains":"Bolečine pri rasti","Coiled Garden":"Vrtni vrt","Mastery: Knotwork":"Vedenje: vezanje","First Hunt":"Prvi lov